## Why This Is Asked

This question probes understanding of idempotent POST semantics, deduplication guarantees, and retry behavior. It requires concrete test cases and tooling choices, aligning with real-world API testing needs while staying accessible to beginners.

## Key Concepts

- Idempotency-Key semantics
- Deduplication and idempotent operations
- Retry strategies for 5xx and their impact on state
- Conflict handling (409)
- Tooling choices (Postman/Newman, pytest, httpx)

