## Code Example

```javascript
// Example Express snippet demonstrating idempotency handling
const orders = new Map();
app.post('/orders', async (req, res) => {
  const key = req.headers['idempotency-key'];
  if (!key) return res.status(400).send({error:'Idempotency-Key required'});
  if (orders.has(key)) return res.json({ orderId: orders.get(key).orderId, cached:true });
  const orderId = generateOrderId();
  // simulate payment call etc.
  orders.set(key, { orderId });
  res.json({ orderId });
});
```

